# Coding agent for omp, forge, and codecompanion. Clients use the alias, so a
# quant swap needs no client change. A base swap can: check `ollama show` for
# capabilities clients rely on (tools, thinking), then `omp models refresh`.
# Base chosen by agent-bench (laguna-q4 5/6, 2026-10-28).
FROM laguna-xs-2.1:q4_K_M
# Clients sized to this: omp discovers it as contextWindow; forge max_tokens +
# compact.token_threshold must stay below it.
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
# laguna aborts with "token repeat limit reached" on requests without a
# system message; this default fixes those. A client's own system message
# replaces it, and some still abort the same way: codecompanion and forge
# title generation (2026-10-28), so new conversations go untitled.
SYSTEM You are a helpful assistant.
